       "Counting tick marks instead of the spaces between them"
      ],
      "references": [
       "Siegler et al. (2010), IES practice guide, rec. 2",
       "Common Core Standards Writing Team (2013), Progressions for Number and Operations—Fractions, 3-5"
      ]
